  <div class="container contact-list"><section class="split-content"><h2>Research & professional enquiries</h2><div><p>A verified professional email address will be added here. This channel is not yet configured.</p><div class="notice">Please do not send patient information, medical records, or urgent health questions. This website does not offer clinical appointments or individualized medical advice.</div></div></section><a href="/book/"><div><h2>Performance bookings</h2><p>Wharton Chan or The Marmalade Jammers — tell us about your event.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></span></a><a href="/admissions/book/"><div><h2>Admissions & mentorship</h2><p>Application support and longer-term academic exploration.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></span></a></div>
</Layout>
